Inputs:
1. One system of norms from the "Systems of Norms"-folder.
2. One or more cases from the "Cases"-folder. 

Task:
Formalize the system of norms and apply it to the cases. 

Variant 1: 
1. Establish some desiderata - i.e., which outputs do you expect from the formal account? Motivate.
2. Choose a logic - Motivate. 
3. Formalize and apply. 
4. Compare the ouptus with the desiderata and discuss your results.
